{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "`load vars` on a read builds file.read with Template=true, so the file's own %name% is filled from memory\nbefore the content is returned. A plain read with no such phrase leaves the text as written (%name% raw).\nnote.txt holds \"Hello %name%\"; with %name% = \"World\" the filled read says \"Hello World\", the plain one does not.",
